{
  "description": "Trophic-dynamics simulator — a config-declared species roster and feeding-edge graph. Step/Run advance a discrete generation: producers regrow toward capacity, consumers gain from what they eat and lose to predation and decay; node radii and count labels track population, and narration explains what changed. Remove/Boost the config-designated species to trigger a cascade. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
